nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Then East bids the major they don't have 3@S here, to allow the strong hand to declare. By bidding 3@S East shows heart. It is a bit complicated and if you don't want to learn it, that is fine.|
