up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have been in worse contracts. 3N is a reasonable bid, but needs some luck to make. I would have played the hand a bit differently. A better play is to ignore the @SA completely: and just play clubs. If that works, you have 9 tricks, with one heart trick. And if it doesn't work, you still have the possibility of making the hand.|
