mb|1H|mb|D|mb|3H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Interesting choice of bids. If you play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenafterovercall,Bergen Raises After an Overcall ^*N|CP||FP||at| or over a double (which I recommend), then 3@H shows 0-6 with 4 hearts. And even if you don't play Bergen Raises are on, 3@H shows 0-9 with 4 hearts. |
